WEBVTT

00:00:01.630 --> 00:00:04.660
All of you are going to be born again!

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:07.730
And I'll be waiting for you!

00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:17.740
As time flows on, we are all being born and reborn moment by moment.

00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:20.750
The instant that nothing becomes something...

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:23.370
is now!

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:32.320
What happened?

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:33.130
Mikono?

00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:35.260
Happy birthday!

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:45.230
No way!

00:02:24.050 --> 00:02:27.460
Hah. Your smells are so weak.

00:02:27.460 --> 00:02:29.040
How is he here?

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:33.180
It's that beast boy!

00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:41.240
Those who do not complete the rite of passage will not grow.

00:02:41.990 --> 00:02:47.930
Being reborn from the darkness was a good trial for them.

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:51.310
Get the girls back! He's after women!

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:52.860
That's discrimination!

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:55.820
Give it a rest! Do what he said and get away!

00:02:59.670 --> 00:03:01.300
We're up against just one person!

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:03.760
Show me what you learned in hand-to-hand training!

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:05.240
Follow my lead!

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:10.420
What?

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:14.460
Donar!

00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:15.800
Professor!

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:17.280
Hold it!

00:03:17.850 --> 00:03:19.800
I'll handle this with my holes!

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:20.840
Holes?

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:31.040
Whoa!

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:32.690
That Special Training of the Grave really worked!

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:35.190
Spatial Augmentation!

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:42.070
They make a great team.

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:43.990
It's like they're synchronized!

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:45.830
The wife is supporting the husband.

00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:51.250
That power of reversal!

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:52.620
Reversal?

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:55.500
He turned that filling power into an opening power!

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:58.320
Are you messing with me?

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:02.260
You get your hands off of Mix!

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:05.390
She smells good, too.

00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:11.640
There's my smelly wench!

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:16.400
Why me?

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:19.730
Defend Mikono!

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:22.450
I'm on it! Mikono!

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:23.570
Mikono, hurry!

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:25.100
Malloy!

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:29.220
Wait!

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:35.710
Don't you dare get between me and my wench.

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:39.590
Did you just call Mikono a wench?

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:40.780
You'll pay for that!

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:53.940
He can even reverse damage he takes?

00:04:58.010 --> 00:05:00.820
My wench!

00:05:02.930 --> 00:05:04.200
Those eyes...

00:05:04.850 --> 00:05:07.200
They're locked straight onto the thing he wants...

00:05:12.050 --> 00:05:12.910
Go back!

00:05:29.310 --> 00:05:32.450
That noise! Not you again!

00:05:35.970 --> 00:05:37.230
Cut that crap out!

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:40.860
I'm only playing the air and the earth.

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:44.960
I'll show you! Reverse!

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:52.080
I've learned to play in dissonance to your tone's inversion.

00:05:54.610 --> 00:05:56.330
Get out of my way!

00:05:56.930 --> 00:05:59.330
That wench is mine!

00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:03.440
All mine!

00:06:16.790 --> 00:06:19.770
He inverted it in one beat.

00:06:21.570 --> 00:06:23.700
The savage strike of a beast.

00:06:24.390 --> 00:06:27.720
That could be interesting.

00:06:35.030 --> 00:06:36.680
You think he's into Mikono?

00:06:36.680 --> 00:06:40.400
Why else would a boy chase a girl like that?

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:42.250
Ooh, how about a boy and another boy?

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:44.250
Why would he...

00:06:46.470 --> 00:06:47.340
A wolf?

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:52.260
Wait, that's him!

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:00.480
What?

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:01.650
You're not getting away from me!

00:07:02.030 --> 00:07:02.900
Reverse!

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:53.860
According to Malloy's report, he's taken Mikono and is hiding in the city.

00:07:54.350 --> 00:07:56.530
You guys search on the ground.

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:57.760
Roger.

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:16.960
Let's split up.

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:18.180
You guys go that way.

00:08:18.710 --> 00:08:19.800
Amata!

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:20.770
Wait for me!

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:36.290
Amata...

00:08:53.650 --> 00:08:56.340
You awake, wench?

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:38.820
Relax. I'm just going to kill you.

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:42.380
Right here in my arms.

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:50.840
Mikono!

00:09:53.290 --> 00:09:56.070
You hear me, Mikage? I've got her.

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:57.800
The source of that smell.

00:09:57.800 --> 00:09:59.160
Hurry up and get me back.

00:10:05.130 --> 00:10:06.540
Can't you hear me?

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:10.460
Does this thing work differently?

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:13.770
Are you there, Mikage?

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:15.180
I'm done here.

00:10:15.180 --> 00:10:19.880
Of course I hear you, beast of love.

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:22.680
Can't I be mean for just a little while?

00:10:23.230 --> 00:10:28.980
I envy you. What you desire is already in your grasp.

00:10:35.430 --> 00:10:37.400
Mikono!

00:10:39.130 --> 00:10:41.160
Wait! Amata!

00:10:45.510 --> 00:10:49.300
Calm down, Amata. I'm sure Mikono's fine.

00:10:49.300 --> 00:10:50.670
Don't say stuff just to make me feel better.

00:10:51.070 --> 00:10:52.380
I'm not!

00:10:53.330 --> 00:10:54.590
I know...

00:10:54.970 --> 00:10:56.860
You know what?

00:10:58.390 --> 00:11:01.560
He's not going to hurt Mikono.

00:11:02.310 --> 00:11:03.740
I'm sure.

00:11:03.740 --> 00:11:05.350
How do you know that?

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:06.860
Well...

00:11:08.490 --> 00:11:11.230
He and Mikono are destined.

00:11:13.210 --> 00:11:17.990
You're not destined to be with her, Amata.

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:39.140
You smell.

00:11:40.070 --> 00:11:41.510
You really stink.

00:11:43.250 --> 00:11:44.680
Why?

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:47.310
Why do you keep insulting me?

00:11:47.950 --> 00:11:50.160
Because I hate you.

00:11:51.050 --> 00:11:52.440
I want to kill you.

00:11:53.090 --> 00:11:54.080
Why?

00:11:54.970 --> 00:11:57.500
What did I do to you?

00:11:58.350 --> 00:12:00.860
You were on Vega, that's what.

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:02.560
What?

00:12:02.560 --> 00:12:03.580
Well, then...

00:12:04.470 --> 00:12:06.700
Then kill me right here!

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:07.660
What?

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:09.320
No, don't.

00:12:11.570 --> 00:12:13.160
No...

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:15.540
Even I couldn't...

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:16.960
Not in a place like this...

00:12:18.270 --> 00:12:19.340
What?

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:31.980
Stop!

00:12:33.570 --> 00:12:36.900
If you say so, I'll stop.

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:41.190
But you're not!

00:12:45.590 --> 00:12:47.680
You want me to lick you, too?

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:02.240
I really, really hate you.

00:13:03.950 --> 00:13:05.180
I want to kill you.

00:13:06.880 --> 00:13:08.680
Are you...

00:13:09.070 --> 00:13:10.600
talking in opposites?

00:13:12.230 --> 00:13:14.560
I only lie to you.

00:13:23.170 --> 00:13:24.440
Why?

00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:26.340
His eyes...

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:29.420
Why are they so familiar?

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:33.520
I finally found you.

00:13:33.520 --> 00:13:34.060
What?

00:13:34.650 --> 00:13:36.830
Come with me, Silvie.

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:41.590
Silvie? You called me that before.

00:13:42.530 --> 00:13:44.160
Silvie and Apollon.

00:13:44.770 --> 00:13:46.720
This is our legend.

00:13:48.070 --> 00:13:53.580
Underneath the Tree of Life, on the day the world began.

00:13:54.970 --> 00:13:59.880
The great Tree of Life governed the lives of all the creatures in the world,

00:13:59.880 --> 00:14:03.690
and of the very planet itself.

00:14:05.390 --> 00:14:07.740
As the two races waged war,

00:14:08.510 --> 00:14:14.200
the Wings of the Sun awakened and pollinated the tree.

00:14:15.190 --> 00:14:21.250
But the flowers wilted before they could bear fruit.

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:27.510
If this continued, eventually, the earth would become unable to support life.

00:14:28.570 --> 00:14:34.640
Apollon and Silvie separated to protect the Tree of Life.

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:38.270
Then, Silvie said...

00:14:39.550 --> 00:14:42.390
I'll be waiting for you.

00:14:42.390 --> 00:14:45.780
Even if I have to wait for 12,000 years.

00:14:47.430 --> 00:14:49.780
Wait for me, Silvie.

00:14:50.830 --> 00:14:53.960
I'll be back for you in 12,000 years.

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:58.040
That's what Apollon said?

00:14:58.040 --> 00:14:58.840
Yeah.

00:14:58.840 --> 00:14:59.700
That's me.

00:15:01.010 --> 00:15:01.790
It's me.

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:06.180
You're... Apollon?

00:15:07.390 --> 00:15:08.670
And you're...

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:10.480
I'm...?

00:15:11.290 --> 00:15:14.810
Are you saying Mikono is Silvie?

00:15:15.550 --> 00:15:18.740
That's impossible. How could you even think that?

00:15:19.510 --> 00:15:20.880
I saw it.

00:15:20.880 --> 00:15:21.810
You saw it?

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:29.820
It's related to Cayenne's vision of the wedding in mourning clothes.

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:31.360
You saw that, too, didn't you, Amata?

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:36.480
What does it matter? Apollon and Silvie are just characters in a story!

00:15:37.130 --> 00:15:39.330
How can you be sure?

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:42.660
I was actually a little glad.

00:15:43.650 --> 00:15:48.000
If Mikono's destiny is to be with him,

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:50.590
then just maybe, you and I could...

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:54.280
Zessica, what are you talking about?

00:15:57.790 --> 00:15:59.050
A butterfly!

00:15:59.050 --> 00:16:00.850
At this hour?

00:16:09.770 --> 00:16:10.860
No!

00:16:11.430 --> 00:16:14.740
I can't be Silvie!

00:16:16.610 --> 00:16:18.910
I'm not Silvie!

00:16:19.550 --> 00:16:20.450
Silvie!

00:16:26.230 --> 00:16:27.080
What's that?

00:16:27.910 --> 00:16:29.060
Mikono!

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:30.940
Amata!

00:16:39.170 --> 00:16:40.470
Don't scare me like that, Silvie.

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:48.860
Mikono!

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:50.660
Amata!

00:16:50.660 --> 00:16:51.860
Not him again!

00:16:57.070 --> 00:16:58.530
Amata!

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:02.160
Give it up already!

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:14.180
Amata!

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:16.480
I'm fine.

00:17:16.480 --> 00:17:18.180
I did it.

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:19.680
You did what?

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:21.180
The special training is working.

00:17:21.830 --> 00:17:25.380
I resisted his power, just for a moment.

00:17:25.380 --> 00:17:25.940
Here he comes!

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:32.360
Figured as much. He's coming this way.

00:17:33.050 --> 00:17:35.720
I'll keep his attention off Mikono.

00:17:35.720 --> 00:17:36.740
You contact Cayenne!

00:17:39.670 --> 00:17:42.790
Damn it. He's being the hero.

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:54.510
There she is!

00:17:55.130 --> 00:17:56.630
It's Mikono!

00:18:16.050 --> 00:18:17.030
Amata!

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:19.670
Cayenne's coming to help!

00:18:19.670 --> 00:18:21.660
Get out of there!

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:22.900
Not yet!

00:18:22.900 --> 00:18:26.290
I have to keep him on me until Mikono escapes!

00:18:27.230 --> 00:18:28.290
Amata...

00:18:33.810 --> 00:18:35.820
Just die already!

00:18:51.350 --> 00:18:52.960
Damn it...

00:19:01.690 --> 00:19:03.910
I'll kill you! I'll kill you!

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:07.830
As many times as it takes!

00:19:16.810 --> 00:19:21.360
Am I going to die here?

00:19:22.990 --> 00:19:26.120
I'm sinking... into the darkness...

00:19:27.130 --> 00:19:31.080
I'm alone in the darkness again.

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:35.740
Fear not, Amata Sora.

00:19:36.710 --> 00:19:41.780
The darkness is no longer a place to suffer in pain.

00:19:42.510 --> 00:19:44.680
Rid yourself of your attachments.

00:19:44.680 --> 00:19:46.410
That is how you will become connected.

00:19:47.990 --> 00:19:49.220
Yes.

00:19:49.220 --> 00:19:51.450
I'm bound, alone in the darkness.

00:19:51.450 --> 00:19:55.750
I have to free myself from my attachments and my past.

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:09.660
Why won't you stay down?

00:20:09.660 --> 00:20:11.350
Fly, straight in reverse!

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:16.690
Why won't my power work?

00:20:17.070 --> 00:20:21.450
Those free of attachments cannot be led astray!

00:20:28.610 --> 00:20:31.080
Why, you!

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:39.200
Cayenne!

00:20:39.200 --> 00:20:40.460
Looks like I made it in time.

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:42.560
Don't let your guard down, Amata!

00:20:42.560 --> 00:20:44.600
I'm gonna finish him off, so—

00:20:55.890 --> 00:20:57.560
Amata! Take him out!

00:21:05.830 --> 00:21:10.160
Don't hold back! Our lives are on the line!

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:18.170
Stop!

00:21:18.470 --> 00:21:20.560
Don't shoot, Amata!

00:21:21.170 --> 00:21:23.380
Mikono!

00:21:26.210 --> 00:21:27.260
Mikono?

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:29.760
Amata, please!

00:21:30.190 --> 00:21:31.320
Don't shoot him!

00:21:32.070 --> 00:21:35.390
Please, forgive him!

00:21:37.630 --> 00:21:38.900
Mikono...

00:22:15.390 --> 00:22:18.200
Mikono... why?

00:22:23.970 --> 00:22:24.990
Perfect.

00:22:25.670 --> 00:22:29.020
Like the butterfly, the symbol of rebirth,

00:22:29.020 --> 00:22:32.840
may forbidden love be reborn.

00:22:33.690 --> 00:22:37.300
After 12,000 years...

00:24:11.650 --> 00:24:13.010
It's getting me excited.

00:24:13.430 --> 00:24:17.720
The 12,000 year old smell of fate is bubbling up.

00:24:18.390 --> 00:24:22.250
Let the stink take you, Silvie.

00:24:22.250 --> 00:24:24.440
It'll only hurt to resist.
